          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">The Goplus 2-in-1 is a fair budget buy for slow under-desk walking
          with an occasional short jog.</strong> Its belt of about 40 by 16 inches, 2.5 mph walking
